Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Goal 24125, needs12.csv after 0086: the electrician row named one of the
owner's three electricians, and the helper's answer naming a notary and a
photographer sat only on the electrician row it was asked from — the notary
and photographer rows still read „nobody / no route", and no „see the
helper" anywhere: BE's cells only existed for a file with a need column.
On a list whose rows are the needs, a found row now names every one of the
owner's contacts who fits it, and a no-route row named in an answer on
this goal says „იხ. დამხმარე" with that helper and that answer. A file
with a need column works as before.

